flowchart TD
  Q[feature + surface + date + environment] --> FR[Resolve feature revision]
  FR --> T[Resolve release or hosted observation]
  T --> A[Fetch active assertions]
  A --> F[Apply qualifiers/freshness]
  F --> C{Contradiction?}
  C -->|yes| W[Show warning + evidence branches]
  C -->|no| P{Parent profile?}
  P -->|yes| D[Derive from child capabilities]
  P -->|no| R[Render y/a/n/u + evidence]
  D --> R
  W --> R
